    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Routed weights store two E2M1 values per byte with one E8M0 scale per 32 input channels. FP8 E4M3FN matrices use E8M0 scales per 128 × 128 tile. Head and group subdimensions line up with checked scale blocks. Engram table scales, cache and non-quantized weights use their declared storage. Execution continues to use the model's analytical arithmetic."
    }
